No one comes down from the roof to take their belongings from the house.
The worker in the field doesn't go home to get his robe.
And how difficult it was for pregnant women and nursing mothers during those days!
But pray that your flight doesn't happen in winter or on a Sabbath day.
For at that time there will be great tribulation, such as has not been from the beginning of the world until this time, no, nor ever shall be.
If God had not decided to shorten those days, no one would have survived. But for His chosen people, He will shorten those days.
If someone says to you, 'Look, there is Christ,' or 'Here he is!' do not believe it.
